From: zerollama <dev@zerollama.local>
Date: Sat, 13 Jun 2026 12:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ollama: llama-kv-ext Phase 15 tensor page bind (b9611)

Staging C API for PA page bind: cell map + K/V tensor introspection.
Resolves hybrid/iSWA/hybrid-iswa to attn kv_cache base view.
WHY separate from llama.h: upstream has no stable writable page-handle API yet.
---
